        "content": "{\n  \"E\": 7.5,\n  \"P\": 8.5,\n  \"L\": 8.0,\n  \"E_Expl\": \"The speaker establishes credibility through a respectful introduction and by outlining their understanding of the issue.\",\n  \"P_Expl\": \"The speaker appeals to the emotions of the audience by addressing the concerns of everyday Americans.\",\n  \"L_Expl\": \"The speaker presents a series of logical proposals to safeguard the interests of taxpayers.\",\n  \"E_clauses\": {\n    \"1\": \"Well, thank you very much, Jim, and thanks to the commission and the University of Mississippi, Ole Miss, for hosting us tonight.\",\n    \"2\": \"I can\u2019t think of a more important time for us to talk about the future of the country.\"\n  },\n  \"P_clauses\": {\n    \"1\": \"And although we\u2019ve heard a lot about Wall Street, those of you on Main Street I think have been struggling for a while, and you recognize that this could have an impact on all sectors of the economy.\",\n    \"2\": \"And you\u2019re wondering, how\u2019s it going to affect me? How\u2019s it going to affect my job? How\u2019s it going to affect my house? How\u2019s it going to affect my retirement savings or my ability to send my children to college?\"\n  },\n  \"L_clauses\": {\n    \"1\": \"So we have to move swiftly, and we have to move wisely.\",\n    \"2\": \"And I\u2019ve put forward a series of proposals that make sure that we protect taxpayers as we engage in this important rescue effort.\",\n    \"3\": \"Number one, we\u2019ve got to make sure that we\u2019ve got oversight over this whole process; $700 billion, potentially, is a lot of money.\",\n    \"4\": \"Number two, we\u2019ve got to make sure that taxpayers, when they are putting their money at risk, have the possibility of getting that money back and gains, if the market \u2014 and when the market returns.\",\n    \"5\": \"Number three, we\u2019ve got to make sure that none of that money is going to pad CEO bank accounts or to promote golden parachutes.\",\n    \"6\": \"And, number four, we\u2019ve got to make sure that we\u2019re helping homeowners, because the root problem here has to do with the foreclosures that are taking place all across the country.\"\n  }\n}",
